{"ID":"20240522082249-4iz4r3r","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240522082249-4iz4r3r","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240522082249-4iz4r3r\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240522093152-z573wob\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240522093152-51cx0rt\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240522093152-mfup264\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:107,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:139\u0026#125;","title":"張醫師的食道腫瘤案例","type":"doc","updated":"20240522093510"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240522093152-z573wob","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522093152-z573wob","updated":"20240522093214"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一、【食道腫瘤案例】 "}]},{"ID":"20240522093152-qzlep28","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522093152-qzlep28","updated":"20240522093152"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"◎12-6-2008"}]},{"ID":"20240522093152-mfup264","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522093152-mfup264","updated":"20240522093510"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"C.B.C.男性，69歲，中等結實身材，年輕時為大廚，體力活動不少，因此仍看得出鍛練過的肌肉，病史：攝護腺腫大，2005年心臟冠狀動脈阻塞，開刀放了三個支架，自此降壓藥、稀血藥未停，2008年三月中風，右側半身不遂"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"（倪師所言甚是，此舉不但未能阻止中風，反而進一步導至腦血管意外）"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，至今恢復良好，唯右手無法寫字，有時無法說話。近來因吞嚥困難，吃固體食物會有卡住感，並引起胸口悶痛，只能吃流質食物，經醫院作鋇餐攝影檢查，發現食道近賁門處有腫瘤，高度懷疑惡性，要求作切片檢查。"}]},{"ID":"20240522093152-gws1slk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522093152-gws1slk","updated":"20240522093219"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"患者的女兒說已經約好，明天作切片，紅著眼問我，如果是惡性還有机會嗎？我答道：不開刀，不化療，不放療，沒有切片"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"（請遵倪師三不一沒有政策）"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，一定有机會。"}]},{"ID":"20240522093152-1ihmhpo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522093152-1ihmhpo","updated":"20240522093152"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"請給您父親一星期的時間，吞嚥若沒改善，我再幫他轉診，請我的恩師幫忙。患者的女兒遲疑一會兒，說：我會排除眾議，取消切片檢查。（患者子女眾多，意見不一，誰作了決定，誰就承擔責任與壓力，這樣的戲碼每天都在上演，難啊！）"}]},{"ID":"20240522093152-5xhteie","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522093152-5xhteie","updated":"20240522093152"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"患者主訴：吞嚥困難，吃固體食物會有卡住感，並引起胸口悶痛，（尤其在中庭穴處特別痛），只能吃流質食物。餘症：胃口不佳，反酸，不覺餓，半夜兩點必醒不能回睡，手足不冷，不易出汗，小便色淡黃，有未盡感，尿頻，夜尿一次，口渴正常，喜涼飲，大便每日兩次，量少，成形，軟而黏，並帶有紅色黏稠物。"}]},{"ID":"20240522093152-cd62z88","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522093152-cd62z88","updated":"20240522093152"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"脈診：右寸、關部及左關皆如豆之短脈且極硬，重按不減。"}]},{"ID":"20240522093152-494u12u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522093152-494u12u","updated":"20240522093152"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"腹診：胸脅苦滿，心下痞硬，臍周四處皆有壓痛，並觸及許多腫塊之物，大小不一。撫之心下區涼，臍下小腹區溫，中庭穴不任按壓（約略近腫瘤投影處）。"}]},{"ID":"20240522093152-rorqrsi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522093152-rorqrsi","updated":"20240522093504"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"倪師曰：穴位往往具診斷與治療雙向性。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522093152-5za5zr1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522093152-5za5zr1","updated":"20240522093225"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"註1、《針灸甲乙經》：胸脅支滿，隔塞，飲食不下，嘔吐，食復出，中庭穴主治。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522093152-n0txarq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522093152-n0txarq","updated":"20240522093226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"註2、《針灸大成》：中庭穴主胸脅支滿，噎塞，飲食不下，嘔吐食出，小兒嘔奶。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522093152-o0p76nr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522093152-o0p76nr","updated":"20240522093152"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"舌診：苔薄黃微膩，質暗"}]},{"ID":"20240522093152-oxkf2va","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522093152-oxkf2va","updated":"20240522093152"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"診斷：噎嗝，食道腫瘤，陰實已成。"}]},{"ID":"20240522093152-cetkk8f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522093152-cetkk8f","updated":"20240522093152"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"尚未經切片破壞，須掌握時機，不能手軟，即遵倪師法。"}]},{"ID":"20240522093152-pt4zfhs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522093152-pt4zfhs","updated":"20240522093152"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"處方一【《千金方》紫丸1粒（約0.4公克）】早晨空腹服，不應則再服一粒。"}]},{"ID":"20240522093152-012xsw9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522093152-012xsw9","updated":"20240522093458"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"註："},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"紫丸"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"為仲景"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"走馬湯"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"之變方（巴豆去殼油1杏仁2赤石脂1代赭石1）蜜丸如小豆。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522093152-np7stcf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522093152-np7stcf","updated":"20240522093451"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"註：自古醫家咸認為代赭石為收斂藥，為了防止巴豆峻下太過，此說有待商榷，臨床印證，應從"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"倪師說法，代赭石，具金石藥之攻堅特性。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522093152-25i7qy1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522093152-25i7qy1","updated":"20240522093448"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"註："},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"咽喉至肛門，整條消化道之腫瘤，不論良性惡性，皆有運用走馬湯，紫丸，三物備急丸的機會但須遵倪師告誡，如果已動過手術、化療的病患，不可輕用。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522093152-df9n4g7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522093152-df9n4g7","updated":"20240522093431"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"處方二【"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"旋覆花代赭石湯"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（赭石重用30克）、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"黃土湯"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（灶心土重用50克）、生附、柴胡】三天份，早晨空腹服"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"紫丸"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"當大下，利止後服此方，日二服，如利不止，飲冷水一杯即止。"}]},{"ID":"20240522093152-afma6lf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522093152-afma6lf","updated":"20240522093152"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"12-13-08"}]},{"ID":"20240522093152-b2lsqvr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522093152-b2lsqvr","updated":"20240522093152"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"患者自訴：第一天服一粒紫丸後，不到五分鐘，還來不及退去褲子即邊走邊拉，拉了滿地都是，前後共拉了四次。之後，有經驗了，先坐馬桶，再服紫丸。第二天起，每日拉兩三次，體力未減，睡眠轉好，只有夜尿時才起來，手足不冷，大便紅色粘稠物已減少，食物堵到的感覺少了一半，腹診時，腫塊物已觸不到，且無壓痛，唯叩診胃脘部鼓音，乃脹氣也。效不更方，於上方加一味陳皮，灶心土減為30克代者石20克。七天份。"}]},{"ID":"20240522093152-xpgk9mp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522093152-xpgk9mp","updated":"20240522093152"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"12-15-08"}]},{"ID":"20240522093152-ptr0jwn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522093152-ptr0jwn","updated":"20240522093152"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"病情轉變，患者陳述：早晨服藥，傍晚則吐，手足冷，排黑便，整日覺得全腹發脹，完全無食慾，難受至極，自認為是湯藥所至，於是自動停止服湯藥，但仍續服紫丸。"}]},{"ID":"20240522093152-dp1tm7t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522093152-dp1tm7t","updated":"20240522093416"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"事有奚翹，追問才知，患者自覺紫丸有神效，自行增服一粒"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"（哎，什麼天才患者都有！）"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。原來如此，過服峻劑，已傷胃氣，腹診發現，腹大如蛙，叩診全腹鼓音，囑患者：立即停服紫丸，改服此方：【上方加"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"厚朴生姜半夏甘草人參湯"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"、平胃散、少量木香、並重用軻子"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"倪師愛用此藥，消脹氣可謂神也。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"】"}]},{"ID":"20240522093152-lrj9q91","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522093152-lrj9q91","updated":"20240522093152"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1-3-09胃口恢復，已無脹氣，大便成形，無黑便，但紅色黏物仍有一些，堵塞感減少。"}]},{"ID":"20240522093152-r4faa6r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522093152-r4faa6r","updated":"20240522093152"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1-6-09開始續服紫丸，囑隔日服一丸。"}]},{"ID":"20240522093152-u00ojk4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522093152-u00ojk4","updated":"20240522093152"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"改方如下：【黃土湯，利膈湯，桃花湯，四君，軻子，絡石藤，硫黃】"}]},{"ID":"20240522093152-zfywvgu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522093152-zfywvgu","updated":"20240522093353"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"註："},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"利膈湯"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"組成為＜炮附、生半夏、梔子＞與"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"絡石藤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"此四藥乃    "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"倪師治咽喉食道阻塞，必用之要藥"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522093152-1jh6hf9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522093152-1jh6hf9","updated":"20240522093152"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1-10-09堵塞感剩下百分之三十，但有打嗝，再加回旋复代赭湯。"}]},{"ID":"20240522093152-tboirip","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522093152-tboirip","updated":"20240522093152"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"紫丸仍隔日服一丸。"}]},{"ID":"20240522093152-3r0wf5o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522093152-3r0wf5o","updated":"20240522093152"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1-13-09堵塞感幾乎沒有，胃口好，日便一到二次，已沒有紅色黏稠物，診其脈，剩下雙關仍有短豆之脈，處方不便，紫丸改為隔日服半粒。"}]},{"ID":"20240522093152-o441leq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522093152-o441leq","updated":"20240522093152"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1-17-09患者自訴：食量從犯病時，半碗流質食物都吃不下，如今增至兩碗固體食物也沒有問題。"}]},{"ID":"20240522093152-fh3l7pj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522093152-fh3l7pj","updated":"20240522093152"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"囑停服紫丸，續服湯劑以鞏固療效。並問道：伯父，您想回醫院再檢查一次嗎？患者回答：不、不、不，我可不想折磨自己了，我想回中國，過個大年！"}]},{"ID":"20240522093152-5xk6t02","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522093152-5xk6t02","updated":"20240522093152"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"學生孟超報告到此1-17-09"}]},{"ID":"20240522093152-tgof917","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240522093152-tgof917","updated":"20240522093152"}},{"ID":"20240522093152-yzmit1c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522093152-yzmit1c","updated":"20240522093152"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"※   附相關條文，以利檢索。"}]},{"ID":"20240522093152-i23b9yi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522093152-i23b9yi","updated":"20240522093338"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.唐‧孫思邈《備急千金要方》卷五上：紫丸。治小兒變蒸。發熱不解。并挾傷寒溫壯。汗後熱不歇。及腹中有痰癖。哺乳不進。乳則吐見。食癇先寒後熱者方。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"（巴豆三十枚 杏仁五十枚 赤石脂 代赭石各一兩）"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"、、、、無所不療。下不虛人。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"（註：無所不療。下不虛人-----就臨床實際，此語當謹慎對待，否則易僨事。）"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522093152-99zq0dk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522093152-99zq0dk","updated":"20240522093152"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.吉益東洞云：「紫丸治腹胸痛，結毒，或腹滿不大便，或有水氣者。」"}]},{"ID":"20240522093152-g39xtvc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522093152-g39xtvc","updated":"20240522093152"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.南涯先生云：「紫丸治胸腹水停滯，血氣攻心者。其症心腹脹痛，大便不通也，或痢疾熱病，或食滯，或留飲胸痛，或痛風、卒中、中暑、驚風、癲癇、胎毒、疳疾、發狂之類迫心胸者，用之有效也。」"}]},{"ID":"20240522093152-akkyni2","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240522093152-akkyni2","updated":"20240522093152"}},{"ID":"20240522093152-fkqhxwj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522093152-fkqhxwj","updated":"20240522093152"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《傷寒金匱》"}]},{"ID":"20240522093152-vns87ml","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522093152-vns87ml","updated":"20240522093330"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.傷寒發汗，若吐，若下，解後，心下痞硬，噫氣不除者，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"旋覆代赭湯"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240522093152-84ngr2b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522093152-84ngr2b","updated":"20240522093327"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.發汗後，腹脹滿者，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"厚朴生姜半夏甘草人參湯"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240522093152-pysszce","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522093152-pysszce","updated":"20240522093324"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.下血，先便後血，此遠血也，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"黃土湯"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240522093152-xpangmo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522093152-xpangmo","updated":"20240522093322"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.少陰病，下利，便膿血者，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"桃花湯"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240522093152-bqm0d1s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522093152-bqm0d1s","updated":"20240522093317"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.氣利，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"訶黎勒散"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主之。訶黎勒即訶子"}]},{"ID":"20240522093152-5ylyt23","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522093152-5ylyt23","updated":"20240522093310"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":" 老師評語 :"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522093152-mee6pcb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522093152-mee6pcb","updated":"20240522093200"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"    治療各種癌症時，最麻煩的事不是來自對癌症的治療，而是要面對病人與家屬的無知愚昧的想法，請問家屬們，你們要做切片的原因是什麼? 是想知道病人得到的是惡性腫瘤?還是良性腫瘤? 再說切片後就算你知道了，請問你又能如何呢? 西醫師有告訴過你們，經過切片後腫瘤是因何而得到的嗎? 再請問你們，如果你將一個帶殼的生雞蛋拿給西醫去做蛋黃切片，經過西醫用針將蛋殼打個洞後，再刺入蛋黃內抓取一點蛋黃出來做化驗，你們只知道在一邊等待化驗結果，可能等個五天或是更久，但是你們可曾想過這枚雞蛋卻因為這個動作而提早腐爛了，腐爛的雞蛋對病人好嗎? 你自己去吃一個就知道好不好了，因為切片必然導致腫瘤的加速惡化，未來在施治上必然增加病人的危險機率，許多乳癌的病患，從一開始做完切片後，檢驗結果尚未出爐，而乳房中的腫塊就已經因為切片後在三天之內快速變大，而且將持續的加速惡化中。"}]},{"ID":"20240522093152-6a4y6of","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522093152-6a4y6of","updated":"20240522093152"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"   我們因為深知這一點，所以不建議病人去做切片，臨床上沒有做過任何切片的腫瘤病人，治療起來效果迅速，恢復的最好，切過片以後的病人，治療起來將耗費數以十倍的時間與金錢，效果卻還是沒有從未經過切片的來得好，因此請問你們，在發現腫瘤時，有那麼急著要做切片嗎? 還是先給中醫治療一個月看看，有進步再繼續給中醫治療，沒有進步再去給西醫切片，都還來得及，這樣有道理嗎? 我們是想救你們，並不是對西醫反感而做出這種要求的，請你們想清楚後，再來找中醫治療，我現在是非常的堅持一點，就是只要病人先做過切片後，再來找我治療時，我是絕對不會接受你們的求診，因為我不想這麼累了，或許我年事已高，再無體力去幫這類的病人了。"}]},{"ID":"20240522093152-lv4uyie","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522093152-lv4uyie","updated":"20240522093152"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"    使用所謂的走馬當，其中力量強大的巴豆，是救人於危難中的要藥，病人服用後無法禁住排便，邊走邊排出大便，藥名就是因此而來，因為馬是可以邊走邊吃又邊排便的一種動物。猶記得十年前我一位學生，他父親得到大腸癌，由於他們家族有三代祖傳開中藥行的經驗，所以自認為是天下第一的有對中藥了解的水準，病人排便不出，於是查遍所有藥典中可以排便的中藥組合，使用許多藥物後，仍然無法將大便排出，於是只好去台大開刀取出直腸周圍的腫瘤，術後做個人工肛門，就算如此做，一年以後還是因為癌症移轉到肝臟而死於肝癌了，這個案例說明了，就算他們賣中藥歷經三代，但是他們也不敢使用巴豆，同時也不相信中醫，遇到如此重大問題時，也從不問一下老師，當然結果就是死於自己的無知之下，善用巴豆的醫師是可以救苦救難的菩薩，直到目前為止，只要善用中藥，沒有任何便秘不可以排除的，賣中藥的與真正懂中藥如何使用的是二回事，市井之中許多中藥行的藥師，只是一知半解於中藥，卻時常在扮演中醫師的角色，所謂庸醫害人，就在這裡了。"}]},{"ID":"20240522093152-slrrzmi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522093152-slrrzmi","updated":"20240522093152"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"     孟超很優秀，不但書讀的多，而且涉獵極廣，還能善用一般中醫師不敢用的中藥，這是因為他了解中藥的藥性，善用大熱大毒的巴豆，實屬難能可貴，我非常以能有這麼一位優秀的學生為榮，希望所有的學生都能效法他的讀書心細，用藥大膽，這才是真正能救人於苦難中的菩薩智慧了。"}]},{"ID":"20240522093152-51cx0rt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522093152-51cx0rt","updated":"20240522093152"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"漢唐中醫 倪海廈謹記於台北2009年01月30日"}]}]}